# web-terminal-server. The calls live in another MODULE, invisible to punused.
#
# NewSessionManager / WithManagerLogger / WithStatusClassifier: built at
# web-terminal-kiro/routes.go:123-125 and web-terminal-server/main.go:234-239.
# MountAPI + WithCreateGate: web-terminal-kiro/routes.go:166 mounts the session
