# with webhttp.SessionCreateRateLimit.
# WithIdleReaper: web-terminal-server/main.go:237 only (kiro runs no reaper).
# (*SessionManager).Shutdown: drains every session on SIGTERM through
# webhttp.Run's shutdown hook -- web-terminal-kiro/main.go:475 and :489,
# web-terminal-server/main.go:296 and :304.
function NewSessionManager
function WithManagerLogger
function WithStatusClassifier
function WithCreateGate
function WithIdleReaper
method (*SessionManager).MountAPI
method (*SessionManager).Shutdown

